<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-ROMINGER TAKES 10TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ROMINGER TAKES 10TH STAGE OF TOUR OF SPAIN.</headline>
<dateline>AVILA, Spain 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tony Rominger of Switzerland won the 10th stage of the Tour of Spain, a time-trial over 46 kms between El Tiemblo and Avila, on Tuesday. Compatriot Alex Zuelle took the overall lead.</p>
</text>
